sequenceDiagram
  participant B as Browser
  participant R as routes.py
  participant V as votes.submit
  participant S as store (one lock)
  B->>B: sign canonical bytes (sorted keys: name, poll, slots, ts)
  B->>R: POST /api/noodle/slug/vote with name, pub, slots, ts, sig
  R->>R: limits.take_write (60 per IP per 10 min, 300 per poll per h)
  R->>R: body cap 8192 bytes, drafts.ensure
  R->>V: plain poll (e2e poll goes to e2e.vote)
  V->>V: normalize name, clean slots, crop check
  V->>V: ts within 120 s of server clock
  V->>V: Ed25519 verify (small-order keys refused)
  V->>S: store.edit
  S->>S: new name past seat cap 200 gets 409
  S->>S: bind pub or match bound pub, ts newer than last
  S->>S: re-check crop and split, host offer
  S->>S: host vote trims every guest to the new offer
  S-->>B: ok, name, slots (409 stale or full, 403 other key)
